# Exceptions to the container image scan (Trivy, in the pipeline's Build artifact
# stage), one CVE id per line. Only for a finding that does not apply to these
# images: the vulnerable code is never loaded, or the CVE is for another product.
# A real one is fixed (a new base image digest, an upgraded dependency), never
# listed. Each id goes under a comment with the reason and when to look again.
